@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-53 - Create Coupon

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Settings UI" as FE
control "CouponsController" as API
control "CouponsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: coupons" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-53
FE -> API: POST /coupons
API -> Service: Execute Create Coupon
Service -> DB: Read/write coupons
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Coupon khả dụng cho checkout

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Code đã tồn tại -> 409
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập với role admin/manager
Post: Coupon khả dụng cho checkout
Main flow:
1. Admin vào /admin/coupons
2. Admin bấm Create Coupon
3. Admin nhập: code, description, discountType (PERCENT/FIXED),\ndiscountValue, minOrderAmount, maxDiscount, validFrom, validTo,\nusageLimit
4. System gọi API POST /coupons
5. System lưu coupon
end note
@enduml
